  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>Your opponent shatters your upper arm, fracturing it into several pieces.</p><p><strong>Effects:</strong> You suffer a @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.rlDZZTj5PXjuRXa2]{Broken Bone (Major)}. Also, until you’ve spent an Action (using your other arm) sticking the broken limb into an improvised mitella or otherwise accomplished some sort of makeshift immobilization (like tucking it into your belt), the dangling extremity will unbalance and discomfort you enough for a -20 penalty to all Agility Tests.</p>"
    },
